<p style="line-height:normal;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-autospace:none;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:13.0pt;">In addition, the first stage of alterations and additions to Telopea Park School to convert it to a full High School has been completed, giving 24 classrooms and 18<strong>&nbsp;</strong>other rooms with a total capacity of 950<strong>.&nbsp;</strong></span></p>
